## Why This Is Asked

Assess ability to design streaming PCA with drift, privacy, and governance integration at scale.

## Key Concepts

- Online Incremental PCA, mini-batch updates, drift detection
- Streaming imputation, feature scaling, memory budgeting
- Differential privacy in streaming aggregation, per-tenant sharing
- Loadings interpretation and governance alert mapping

## Code Example

```javascript
// Skeleton of streaming online PCA update
function update(batch) {
  const X = impute(batch);
  const Xs = scale(X);
  components = incrementalPCA(components, Xs, k);
  const loadings = components.loadings;
  publish(loadings);
}
```

